BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ec33c5fc-4931-4ee5-8824-24f7a409abec@fit.local
DTSTAMP:20261019T082230Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:FIT: Skill & Mobility Day (Active Recovery)
DESCRIPTION:Sunday Skill & Mobility Routine (~30–35 min, no muscular failure):\n1. GMB Wrist Prep + Towel Shoulder Dislocates (5m)\n2. Handstand Practice: Chest-to-wall holds / heel pulls (10m timer)\n3. Crow / Crane Pose balance holds (5m timer)\n4. L-Sit (3x 15-20s) + Seated Pike Compression Leg Lifts (3x 10s)\n5. Skin the Cat / German Hang on Pull-up Bar (3x 3-5 slow reps)\n6. Runner's Mobility: Couch Stretch + Calf/Achilles Stretch (5m)
END:VEVENT
