SUMMARY:FIT: Run 1 — Easy Aerobic (5–6 km)
DESCRIPTION:5–6 km Easy Aerobic Run (~35–40 min)\nTarget HR: < 148 bpm (Zone 2 conversational pace)\nOptional finisher: 4x 20s smooth strides with 40s walk/jog recovery.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7e8d9b55-e81d-4d26-b788-91d483912bb7@fit.local
DTSTAMP:20261019T082230Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:FIT: Full Recommended Routine (RR)
DESCRIPTION:r/bodyweightfitness Recommended Routine (Full Body — No Bands/Barbells)\n\n1. Warm-Up (5-8m): Towel/broomstick shoulder dislocates, Squat sky reaches, Wrist prep, Deadbugs (30s), Arch hangs (10), Dip support hold (30-60s)\n2. Pair A (3x5-8, 90s rest): Pull-Ups (or L-Sit Pull-Ups) + Squat Progression (Bulgarian Split Squats -> Shrimp/Pistol Squats)\n3. Pair B (3x5-8, 90s rest): Parallel Bar Dips + Bodyweight Hinge (Single-Leg RDL -> Towel Sliding Leg Curls -> Nordic Negatives)\n4. Pair C (3x5-8, 90s rest): Horizontal Rows (or Wide/Elevated Rows) + Push-Up Progression (Full -> Diamond -> Pseudo Planche Push-Ups)\n5. Core Triplet (3x8-12, 60s rest): Hanging Knee/Leg Raises + Copenhagen/Side Plank (30s/side) + Reverse Hypers/Arch Body Holds
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d0544540-0b33-40bd-bd8a-927437b4034c@fit.local
DTSTAMP:20261019T082230Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:FIT: Run 2 — Tempo / Quality (7–8 km)
DESCRIPTION:7–8 km Quality / Tempo Run (~50–60 min)\n- First 2 km: Easy warm-up (< 145 bpm)\n- Middle 3–4 km: Brisk Tempo (155–165 bpm, ~6:45–7:10 /km)\n- Final 2 km: Easy cool-down (< 148 bpm)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
