DTSTAMP:20261019T082230Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:FIT: Full Recommended Routine (RR)
DESCRIPTION:r/bodyweightfitness Recommended Routine (Full Body — No Bands/Barbells)\n\n1. Warm-Up (5-8m): Towel/broomstick shoulder dislocates, Squat sky reaches, Wrist prep, Deadbugs (30s), Arch hangs (10), Dip support hold (30-60s)\n2. Pair A (3x5-8, 90s rest): Pull-Ups (or L-Sit Pull-Ups) + Squat Progression (Bulgarian Split Squats -> Shrimp/Pistol Squats)\n3. Pair B (3x5-8, 90s rest): Parallel Bar Dips + Bodyweight Hinge (Single-Leg RDL -> Towel Sliding Leg Curls -> Nordic Negatives)\n4. Pair C (3x5-8, 90s rest): Horizontal Rows (or Wide/Elevated Rows) + Push-Up Progression (Full -> Diamond -> Pseudo Planche Push-Ups)\n5. Core Triplet (3x8-12, 60s rest): Hanging Knee/Leg Raises + Copenhagen/Side Plank (30s/side) + Reverse Hypers/Arch Body Holds\n\nNote: Leave 1–2 reps in reserve on Squats/SL-RDLs today to keep legs fresh for Saturday's 10 km long run.
